<title>USA: CheckFree signs deal with Barnett.</title>
<headline>CheckFree signs deal with Barnett.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA, Ga. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>CheckFree Corp said Wednesday it signed a five-year deal to provide bill payment services for customers of Barnett Banks Inc.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>CheckFree, the largest provider of home banking and bill payment processing systems for the U.S. retail banking industry, counts as clients 18 of the nation's 25 largest banks, the company said. It has 248 clients total.</p>
</text>
